Sources:
- WCAG 2.2: https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/
- WAI-ARIA Authoring Practices Guide: https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/
- void-harness accessibility doctrine: packages/core/skills/accessibility/SKILL.md

Adapted:
- Kept WCAG 2.2 AA as the floor plus semantic, keyboard, focus, name, contrast, target, error, motion, and assistive evidence.
- Requires human-observable interaction evidence where static analysis cannot prove behavior.

Rejected:
- Static-tool-only certification, visual-taste review, product-flow ownership, and implementation authority.
